local _, AP = ...

--[[ Library Books: the books for Friend of the Library, four routes -- each
	faction, each continent. Each book is a LOOT step that ticks once the book
	is in your bags; flight points tick once learned (a flight master's map,
	opened, says which you know); flights, runs and boats tick as you arrive,
	and every trip (the hearth too) once you've done the step after it. Each
	route starts and ends in the faction's librarian city (Garion Wendell in
	Stormwind, Owen Thadd in Undercity).

	The book spots are the owner's, checked in game. The flight masters are
	Forever's own, saved from the client with /apg flights (2026-10-14); the
	boats and zeppelins are the Instance Journal's, stood on in game. Feralas's
	book is left out until its Forever spot is known. The two Blackrock
	Mountain books have no map spot (the client gives that map no id): their
	steps tick from the item alone. The routes were planned by two planners
	each, judged, checked against the data and fixed (Tools/smoke_test.py
	checks every book's spot again).

	Assumed known at the start: only the faction's capital flight points; any
	other is learned on the way, before the route flies to it.
]]

local function Register(def)
	local ok, why = AP:RegisterGuide(def)
	if not ok then geterrorhandler()(why) end
end

